sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Beat (cron)
  participant Blue as Blue gen N
  participant DB as registry DB
  participant Green as Green gen N+1
  participant Op as You
  B->>Blue: observe ctx %, idle/busy, attached, cards
  Note over B: decide_bg: noop · prewarm · swap · defer
  B->>Green: prewarm (boot, ingest baton)
  Blue->>DB: write handoff + canary questions
  Green->>DB: readback (answers anchored in Blue's state)
  B->>DB: grade readback
  alt PASS and quota ok
    B->>DB: swap canonical -> Green
    B->>Blue: retire with resume command
    B->>B: verify by effect, reap gen N-1
  else HOLD
    B->>Op: card: rotation needs a human look
  end
